  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-28T20:39:58.096Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like for there to be a menu that would let you select WHY you're voting to kick someone from a lobby such as:\n\n- Being a child. (Under the age of 13.)\n- Being a crasher/toxic client user.\n- Harassing players.\n- ERPing in public.\n\nAlso the Vote Kick button seems to be broken. It rarely works.\n\nThis will help let people know why they are voting to kick someone instead of making a fuss with people asking \"Why are we kicking this person?\" The reason would be given when the vote kick goes into action.",
